{"title":"칸타렐라","artist":"흑토끼","sourceId":"reference:RHHta5fSHht8PkOVPiAz","sourceHash":"53b2d8a5f2e283d8e0e6a8ea05f6ca614955285a48b5be915bb984fe30913bfb","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":35084893,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":14.06,"end":20.57,"text":"見つめ合う その視線 閉じた世界の中","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":20.57,"end":27.15,"text":"気づかない ふりをしても 酔いを悟られそう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":27.15,"end":33.86,"text":"焼け付くこの心 隠して近づいて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":33.86,"end":40.6,"text":"吐息感じれば 痺れるほど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":40.6,"end":47.67,"text":"ありふれた恋心に 今罠を仕掛けて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":47.67,"end":67.33,"text":"僅かな隙間にも 足跡残さないよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":67.33,"end":73.8,"text":"見え透いた言葉だと 君は油断してる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":73.8,"end":80.57,"text":"良く知った劇薬なら 飲み干せる気がした","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":80.57,"end":87.15,"text":"錆びつく鎖から 逃れるあても無い","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":87.15,"end":93.92,"text":"響く秒針に 抗うほど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":93.92,"end":100.8,"text":"たとえば深い茂みの中 滑り込ませて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":100.8,"end":133.65,"text":"繋いだ汗の香りに ただ侵されそう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":133.65,"end":141.01,"text":"ありふれた恋心に 今罠を仕掛ける","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":141.01,"end":145.67000000000002,"text":"僅かな隙間 覗けば","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":145.67000000000002,"end":147.41,"text":"捕まえて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":147.41,"end":153.76,"text":"たとえば深い茂みの中 滑り込ませて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":153.76,"end":162.28,"text":"繋いだ汗の香りに ただ侵されてる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}